  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNITAR 2021 Fellowship programme in peacemaking and preventive diplomacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fellowship Programme in Peacemaking and Preventive Diplomacy is the only programme within the UN system to provide training in preventive diplomacy and peacemaking. The Programme provides advanced training to mid and senior-level female and male officials and staff from the substantive departments, agencies and peace missions of the United Nations, from regional organizations, and senior and mid-level diplomats from Foreign Ministries. Thirty-five to forty female and male senior and mid-level Fellows will be carefully selected to participate.</narrative>
  </description>
